WEBVTT

00:01:57.556 --> 00:02:00.007
But luckily, I'm here to help you.

00:02:00.007 --> 00:02:01.574
(Laughter)

00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:03.924
Here are five things you must know

00:02:03.924 --> 00:02:07.445
for surviving the impending
Chinese millennial invasion.

00:02:07.445 --> 00:02:08.665
(Laughter)

00:02:09.503 --> 00:02:12.847
Number one: We are many!

00:02:12.847 --> 00:02:14.095
(Laughter)

00:02:14.665 --> 00:02:17.674
Do you know how many
American millennials you have today?

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.424
90 million.

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.346
That's a lot.

00:02:22.657 --> 00:02:25.606
Now, imagine that times five.

00:02:26.136 --> 00:02:28.508
That's how many of us there are.

00:02:28.508 --> 00:02:31.310
With a population of around 400 million,